# agentic-ai — Cursor Rules

## Architecture
The A2A agent is a **semantic proxy**, not a discovery provider.
- Client → A2A Agent → Spring Boot (always)
- Client NEVER calls Spring Boot directly

## Key files
- `a2a-agent/agent/agent.py` — ADK tools + root_agent
- `a2a-agent/server.py` — FastAPI A2A server (JSON-RPC)
- `a2a-client/client.py` — A2A client
- `spring-boot-app/src/.../controller/` — REST endpoints (:8080)

## Ports
- Spring Boot: `:8080`
- A2A Agent: `:8001`

## Conventions
- Tool functions: plain Python, docstring = LLM description, type hints = JSON schema
- Always return `{"success": bool, ...}` — never raise exceptions from tools
- One tool per action
- Agent model: `gemini-2.0-flash`
